  "slug": "lesson-builder",
  "name": "Lesson Builder",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate complete bilingual TEFL/ESL courses with configurable page types — lessons, exams,\nflashcards, conversations, pronunciation drills, worksheets, and syllabi. Works for any language pair and topic.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `lesson-builder`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lesson-builder@claude-community` from `ddtraveller/lesson-builder`.\n\nGenerate complete, standalone bilingual courses from a single prompt. Lessons, exams, flashcards, conversations, pronunciation drills, worksheets, and syllabi — any language pair, any topic, zero dependencies.",
